add('/product/sms/','Texts and voicemail from your business number.','Product / SMS & Voicemail','Send and receive text messages from the same number you call from, and let customers leave a voicemail when you cannot answer.', [('Text from your business number','SMS texting is an optional add-on. Each user gets 300 texts a month. Conversations sit in Messages, next to your calls, so the whole team sees the history.',['Two-way texting from your Dialnytics number','300 texts per user each month','One-time registration fee for business texting']),('Registration comes first','Carriers ask businesses to register before sending texts. For US numbers this is A2P 10DLC registration. We collect your business details, submit the registration and switch texting on once it is approved.',['Business name and website needed','Approval time depends on the carrier','Send only messages people have asked for']),('Voicemail is included','Every plan includes voicemail. Missed callers can leave a message, and you can play it back from the Voicemails page in the dialer.',['Included in every plan','New voicemails are highlighted','Call back from the same screen'])],group='product',label='SMS & Voicemail')
