 ('Cookies and retention','Essential cookies protect forms and admin sessions. This build does not include advertising pixels or third-party analytics. Requests are retained only as needed for enquiries, agreed services, disputes and applicable record-keeping requirements; contact us for the applicable retention period or a deletion request.',[]),
