 ('Confirm destination coverage','Confirm your required destinations and number type before payment. Global and European requests are reviewed for the actual destination list. Unconfirmed routes are not a promise of availability.',[]),
 ('Lawful use remains required','Unlimited does not permit fraud, harassment, unlawful automated calling, caller-ID abuse or ignoring opt-outs. See the Acceptable Use policy. We do not publish a hidden numerical fair-use allowance on this page.',[]),
